# Host Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe — copy values into whisperx.env or the shell.
# Never commit secrets. Weights are OpenMDW-1.1; first serve downloads from Hub.
# Not the analysis venv. Serve stays operator-owned on a CUDA host.

# TRANSCRIPTX_TRANSCRIPTION_PROVIDER=nemotron_vllm
# TRANSCRIPTX_NEMOTRON_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
# NEMOTRON_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL=nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Transcribe-30B-A4B

# Explicit opt-in only — never a silent cloud NIM:
# TRANSCRIPTX_NEMOTRON_ALLOW_REMOTE=1

# Dev/CI only — no GPU weights:
# TRANSCRIPTX_NEMOTRON_STUB=1
